Peermusic has signed a publishing deal for the song catalog of Gram Parsons and will assume worldwide administration, it was announced last week by Peermusic CEO Mary Megan Peer and U.S./ Canada president Jamie Cerreta. Perhaps more than any other artist, Parsons &#x2014; who was inducted posthumously into the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame on November 14 &#x2014; was responsible for the country-rock fusion that has spawned everything from the music of the Eagles to the entire Americana genre. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories ‘Ted Lasso’ Renewed for Season 5 at Apple TV, With Jason Sudeikis Returning Samantha Morton to Receive BFI Fellowship

Polly Parsons said: &#x201C;My father&#x2019;s music has always had a life of its own, reaching across generations and continuing to inspire artists and listeners in ways I don&#x2019;t think even he could have imagined. It means so much to me to help preserve that legacy while also finding new ways for people to discover his songs. His music was never bound by genre or convention, and I think that&#x2019;s why it still resonates so deeply today. My hope is that this new partnership will not only honor the incredible body of work he left behind but also introduce his music to a whole new generation of fans. Keeping his spirit and his songs alive is something I hold very close to my heart.&#x201D;

Jamie Cerreta commented: &#x201C;Gram&#x2019;s music is an enduring testament to how great songs remain in our hearts. All of us at Peermusic are so honored to represent his songs and to see his work celebrated through his recent induction into the Rock n Roll Hall of Fame. I am personally so happy to be working with Polly and Vector Management to help another generation discover the greatness of Gram Parsons.&#x201D;

+ The Songwriters Hall of Fame has announced the posthumous induction of legendary singer-songwriter Roger Miller, known for such hits at &#x201C;King of the Road&#x201D; and &#x201C;Dang Me.&#x201D; Miller, who died in 1992 at age 56, was honored during an intimate ceremony held November 17, 2026, at BMI headquarters on Music Row in Nashville. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

